{
  "bvid": "BV1Nf4ozWEo1",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "6355b41c0056222955fe9c94ebac75d5bf8ea540a3d6c6ed43cacf20bfefd850",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 2060,
      "end_ms": 4540,
      "text": "如果曾经参与过"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 4540,
      "end_ms": 9360,
      "text": "或者说被裹挟的参与过一些犯罪活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 11360,
      "end_ms": 15840,
      "text": "对于这个底层人民劳动群众啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 15840,
      "end_ms": 17460,
      "text": "施加过伤害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 17460,
      "end_ms": 19640,
      "text": "犯下过罪孽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 19640,
      "end_ms": 22000,
      "text": "那么对于这种人呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 22000,
      "end_ms": 23980,
      "text": "实际上从阶级分析上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 23980,
      "end_ms": 27480,
      "text": "他们实际上是资产阶级的帮凶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 27480,
      "end_ms": 29700,
      "text": "也就是说它是一种小资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 29700,
      "end_ms": 30100,
      "text": "是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 30100,
      "end_ms": 32220,
      "text": "小资产阶级呢是暴利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 32220,
      "end_ms": 33720,
      "text": "小资产阶级啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 33720,
      "end_ms": 35200,
      "text": "恐吓暴力的小战役"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 35200,
      "end_ms": 37990,
      "text": "用来生产这种统治工具的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 37990,
      "end_ms": 40710,
      "text": "这些人实际上是统治机器的一部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 40710,
      "end_ms": 45000,
      "text": "是统治机器的最底层是他的微真啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 45000,
      "end_ms": 49580,
      "text": "或者说是用来啊汲取榨取啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 49580,
      "end_ms": 53180,
      "text": "被剥削者被体系化的榨取之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 53180,
      "end_ms": 55860,
      "text": "剩下的残渣里的最后一滴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 57460,
      "end_ms": 58180,
      "text": "生命力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 59500,
      "end_ms": 61060,
      "text": "那么对于这种存在呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 61060,
      "end_ms": 65220,
      "text": "对于这类人呢不能够直接争取"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 66820,
      "end_ms": 71040,
      "text": "也不要以为通过温情抚慰"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 71040,
      "end_ms": 73260,
      "text": "宽容原谅"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 73840,
      "end_ms": 76040,
      "text": "把他们变成温和的存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 76040,
      "end_ms": 78580,
      "text": "变成看似无罪的存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 78580,
      "end_ms": 80260,
      "text": "就是在解放他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 80260,
      "end_ms": 82560,
      "text": "就是在对历史"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 85660,
      "end_ms": 89340,
      "text": "负责为什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 91860,
      "end_ms": 93180,
      "text": "因为这样做的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 94260,
      "end_ms": 97020,
      "text": "一个这种犯罪分子要靠一个革命家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 97020,
      "end_ms": 100450,
      "text": "而且往往最最最糟糕的事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 101740,
      "end_ms": 102960,
      "text": "女性活动家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 102960,
      "end_ms": 111460,
      "text": "女性革命家永远永远不应当用你的爱情怜悯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 111460,
      "end_ms": 112620,
      "text": "但有的时候不是爱情啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 112620,
      "end_ms": 116960,
      "text": "我觉得怜悯情感情欲性关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 116960,
      "end_ms": 123680,
      "text": "甚至说是婚姻或者说是生育权来收买它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 123680,
      "end_ms": 125180,
      "text": "贿赂他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 125610,
      "end_ms": 128590,
      "text": "这会造成极为恶劣的历史影响"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 128590,
      "end_ms": 130350,
      "text": "因为这意味着什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 130350,
      "end_ms": 133310,
      "text": "犯错误是可以被奖励的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 133590,
      "end_ms": 134710,
      "text": "他不需要赎罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 135750,
      "end_ms": 138930,
      "text": "竟然直接可以获得历史的奖励"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 139450,
      "end_ms": 142820,
      "text": "这样做的女性活动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 142820,
      "end_ms": 146930,
      "text": "女性革命家犯了严重的小钻这一错误"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 146930,
      "end_ms": 151350,
      "text": "他以为啊我把这个犯罪型的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 151350,
      "end_ms": 157170,
      "text": "或者把这样一个误入歧途的人拯救了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 157290,
      "end_ms": 160670,
      "text": "可以让他不再去残害很多人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 160670,
      "end_ms": 163190,
      "text": "那么他不再残害很多人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 163190,
      "end_ms": 166210,
      "text": "就是我对历史的贡献了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 166210,
      "end_ms": 167930,
      "text": "那么我搞定这一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 167930,
      "end_ms": 169530,
      "text": "我就可以过日子了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 169530,
      "end_ms": 172720,
      "text": "我就可以不再去做一个坚决的革命者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 172720,
      "end_ms": 173740,
      "text": "继续去努力的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 173740,
      "end_ms": 176770,
      "text": "我就可以做一些外围的事务性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 176770,
      "end_ms": 177650,
      "text": "无意义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 177650,
      "end_ms": 180390,
      "text": "无烈度的工作了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 180390,
      "end_ms": 182730,
      "text": "我就可以过日子了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 182730,
      "end_ms": 185610,
      "text": "这个账怎么算都是错的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 186360,
      "end_ms": 187480,
      "text": "他犯下的罪孽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 187480,
      "end_ms": 189040,
      "text": "凭什么他直接过日子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 189040,
      "end_ms": 192560,
      "text": "而且还对子对调了一个革命者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 193550,
      "end_ms": 198950,
      "text": "这种二元关系实际上是洗白了罪恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 200680,
      "end_ms": 202400,
      "text": "如果他真的要被救赎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 202400,
      "end_ms": 203540,
      "text": "要被解放"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 203540,
      "end_ms": 205750,
      "text": "他应当先去赎罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 206150,
      "end_ms": 209610,
      "text": "依凭他所造成的伤害损害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 209610,
      "end_ms": 210670,
      "text": "他要赎罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 211710,
      "end_ms": 214230,
      "text": "他不能那么轻易地被洗白"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 216160,
      "end_ms": 217820,
      "text": "被奖励"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 218260,
      "end_ms": 220080,
      "text": "那么如何赎罪呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 220080,
      "end_ms": 221780,
      "text": "造成多少伤害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 221780,
      "end_ms": 223380,
      "text": "导致了多少家庭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 223380,
      "end_ms": 224740,
      "text": "多少更无辜的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 224740,
      "end_ms": 227230,
      "text": "更弱小的人的伤害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 227510,
      "end_ms": 229750,
      "text": "他必须沉痛承担"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 229750,
      "end_ms": 231070,
      "text": "同等的或者加倍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 231070,
      "end_ms": 235450,
      "text": "这样的伤害由他自己在现实的利益当中承担"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 235450,
      "end_ms": 237750,
      "text": "而不是仅仅在主观状态下承担"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 237750,
      "end_ms": 242209,
      "text": "他必须在现实的利益上去承担"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 242209,
      "end_ms": 243649,
      "text": "如果他因为他所作所为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 243649,
      "end_ms": 244969,
      "text": "导致别人家破人亡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 244969,
      "end_ms": 245789,
      "text": "他要赎罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 245789,
      "end_ms": 247370,
      "text": "甚至他要死亡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 247370,
      "end_ms": 249470,
      "text": "用生命去承担这种代价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 249470,
      "end_ms": 250490,
      "text": "他要牺牲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 250490,
      "end_ms": 251770,
      "text": "要奉献"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 252570,
      "end_ms": 255160,
      "text": "怎么可以用啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 255160,
      "end_ms": 256040,
      "text": "过上美好日子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 256040,
      "end_ms": 256800,
      "text": "过上幸福生活"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 256800,
      "end_ms": 257600,
      "text": "来收买他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 257600,
      "end_ms": 258399,
      "text": "来贿赂他呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 259880,
      "end_ms": 262280,
      "text": "这种做法是对历史的背叛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 263280,
      "end_ms": 265440,
      "text": "这种做法这样去做的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 265440,
      "end_ms": 269640,
      "text": "所谓的女性革命者实际上变成了什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 270750,
      "end_ms": 273390,
      "text": "在鼓励这些人进一步的去作恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 273390,
      "end_ms": 274210,
      "text": "去犯罪呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 274210,
      "end_ms": 275650,
      "text": "无论他做多大的恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 275650,
      "end_ms": 276570,
      "text": "犯多大罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 276570,
      "end_ms": 278870,
      "text": "你都可以这样去设想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 279510,
      "end_ms": 282390,
      "text": "他现在一年可以害两个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 282390,
      "end_ms": 283470,
      "text": "我原谅他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 283470,
      "end_ms": 285289,
      "text": "那他将来的20年30年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 285289,
      "end_ms": 288909,
      "text": "我相当于拯救了相当于拯救了60个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 288909,
      "end_ms": 289809,
      "text": "40个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 289809,
      "end_ms": 290570,
      "text": "60个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 290570,
      "end_ms": 292610,
      "text": "如果他变得更罪恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 292610,
      "end_ms": 294610,
      "text": "他一年可以坑害20个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 294610,
      "end_ms": 295580,
      "text": "30个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 295580,
      "end_ms": 297940,
      "text": "那是不是他未来的20年30年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 297940,
      "end_ms": 301190,
      "text": "就相当于你拯救四四百个900个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 301190,
      "end_ms": 302990,
      "text": "这是个罪恶的攻势"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 302990,
      "end_ms": 303830,
      "text": "他越恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 303830,
      "end_ms": 305350,
      "text": "好像你把他搞定了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 305350,
      "end_ms": 307010,
      "text": "让他上岸南山过日子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 307010,
      "end_ms": 309870,
      "text": "你的历史贡献更大"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 310350,
      "end_ms": 311870,
      "text": "是这样算的吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 311870,
      "end_ms": 313330,
      "text": "可以透支的吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 313330,
      "end_ms": 314810,
      "text": "罪恶可以透支吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 314810,
      "end_ms": 319430,
      "text": "或者说功劳可以罪恶的潜在威胁的取消"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 319430,
      "end_ms": 323110,
      "text": "潜在罪恶的取消就算功劳吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 325980,
      "end_ms": 327460,
      "text": "我可以捅你十刀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 327460,
      "end_ms": 328620,
      "text": "但是我就捅了你一刀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 328620,
      "end_ms": 330140,
      "text": "所以我没捅你九刀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 330140,
      "end_ms": 332180,
      "text": "我就对你有恩了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 333010,
      "end_ms": 334630,
      "text": "哪有这样算的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 334630,
      "end_ms": 336090,
      "text": "这是标准的倒错"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 337330,
      "end_ms": 341150,
      "text": "因为这样去所谓的女性革命家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 341150,
      "end_ms": 344750,
      "text": "这样去爱这么一个潜在的施暴者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 344750,
      "end_ms": 346910,
      "text": "有罪恶者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 348270,
      "end_ms": 349830,
      "text": "这样去所谓的爱啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 349830,
      "end_ms": 351190,
      "text": "说怜悯和宽恕他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 351190,
      "end_ms": 353090,
      "text": "包容他实际上是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 355360,
      "end_ms": 359800,
      "text": "这个男性就代表凶恶的强力暴力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 361000,
      "end_ms": 366040,
      "text": "残害压迫力这一侧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 366040,
      "end_ms": 369140,
      "text": "那个女的呢代表洗白这一侧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 370640,
      "end_ms": 374339,
      "text": "他不是他所作所为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 374339,
      "end_ms": 375139,
      "text": "不是在拯救"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 375139,
      "end_ms": 375899,
      "text": "在解放"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 375899,
      "end_ms": 377159,
      "text": "他是在洗白"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 377159,
      "end_ms": 380219,
      "text": "那么这个双生子长出来就是什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 380219,
      "end_ms": 386220,
      "text": "强力策和意识形态侧就是统治机器的两侧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 386220,
      "end_ms": 388700,
      "text": "强力和意识形态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 389920,
      "end_ms": 394560,
      "text": "看上去是个最基本的拯救性的噢单元"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 394560,
      "end_ms": 397480,
      "text": "实际上它是最基本的统治单元"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 400740,
      "end_ms": 404470,
      "text": "那么这样的女性呢要摆脱这种小自然义幻想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 404470,
      "end_ms": 407070,
      "text": "摆脱这种好像去搞定的这一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 407070,
      "end_ms": 409310,
      "text": "他就承担了全全部历史使命"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 409310,
      "end_ms": 411180,
      "text": "然后就可以去过日子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 411180,
      "end_ms": 413740,
      "text": "摆脱这样一种对子的妄想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 414900,
      "end_ms": 416440,
      "text": "你拯救这一个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 416440,
      "end_ms": 420010,
      "text": "那么所谓的拯救只是说他不在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 420010,
      "end_ms": 423380,
      "text": "加害了所谓的过平凡日子之前的账怎么算"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 423380,
      "end_ms": 424500,
      "text": "那你说哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 424500,
      "end_ms": 425720,
      "text": "大他者不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 425720,
      "end_ms": 427760,
      "text": "所以之前的上是不能累积的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 427760,
      "end_ms": 429100,
      "text": "大他者不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 429100,
      "end_ms": 430960,
      "text": "人民群众不存在吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 430960,
      "end_ms": 433720,
      "text": "他所作所为造成的损害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 433720,
      "end_ms": 435880,
      "text": "造成的家破人亡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 437540,
      "end_ms": 441920,
      "text": "造成造成了弱小的孩子的悲惨的童年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 441920,
      "end_ms": 445970,
      "text": "造成的那些孤苦无依的老人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 447860,
      "end_ms": 449680,
      "text": "绝望地面对死亡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 449680,
      "end_ms": 450700,
      "text": "面对病痛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 450700,
      "end_ms": 452820,
      "text": "这东西不存在吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 453680,
      "end_ms": 455280,
      "text": "它散播开来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 455280,
      "end_ms": 457380,
      "text": "沉淀在那里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 457660,
      "end_ms": 459660,
      "text": "他只要作为凶手逃遁掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 459660,
      "end_ms": 461620,
      "text": "你还你还帮助他逃遁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 461620,
      "end_ms": 468669,
      "text": "还通过所谓的爱情享乐婚姻来帮助他们逃遁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 468669,
      "end_ms": 470229,
      "text": "那些伤害就不存在了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 470229,
      "end_ms": 471669,
      "text": "那些罪恶就不存在了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 471669,
      "end_ms": 473549,
      "text": "就可以这样被取消吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 473549,
      "end_ms": 476989,
      "text": "你有什么资格代表历史来宽恕他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 479180,
      "end_ms": 481620,
      "text": "你有什么代表那么多受害者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 481620,
      "end_ms": 487859,
      "text": "人民群众的广大的根基来包容他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 487859,
      "end_ms": 489279,
      "text": "如果他要赎罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 489279,
      "end_ms": 491239,
      "text": "他应当被埋葬"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 493580,
      "end_ms": 500380,
      "text": "而不是继续把罪恶的根茎掩藏起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 500920,
      "end_ms": 504760,
      "text": "自肆的蔓延滋长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 505740,
      "end_ms": 509740,
      "text": "这种人对待他的后代会怎么教育他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 510630,
      "end_ms": 511650,
      "text": "去犯罪吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 511650,
      "end_ms": 512750,
      "text": "去作恶吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 512750,
      "end_ms": 514590,
      "text": "会奖励你命运"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 514590,
      "end_ms": 515549,
      "text": "会奖励你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 515549,
      "end_ms": 517309,
      "text": "你的母亲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 519220,
      "end_ms": 522020,
      "text": "就在用这种方式奖励着我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 523659,
      "end_ms": 528180,
      "text": "你的到来就是这种不正义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 529540,
      "end_ms": 533480,
      "text": "所谓的报应的一个最直接的证据"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 533480,
      "end_ms": 537620,
      "text": "你的存在就意味着恶应当被激励"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 539640,
      "end_ms": 540720,
      "text": "应当被贿赂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 541960,
      "end_ms": 543720,
      "text": "应当被满足"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 545040,
      "end_ms": 546640,
      "text": "酱的孩子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 550060,
      "end_ms": 551100,
      "text": "他要走回正道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 551100,
      "end_ms": 554820,
      "text": "他要付出无限大的大无限大的代价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 558180,
      "end_ms": 559300,
      "text": "另外一方面呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 561340,
      "end_ms": 564920,
      "text": "我们说的孩子犯这种错误的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 566960,
      "end_ms": 568600,
      "text": "或者我们说是暴力小资产阶级也好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 568600,
      "end_ms": 571040,
      "text": "最底层的暴力小自然阶级帮凶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 571440,
      "end_ms": 572720,
      "text": "他们难道不是孩子吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 574080,
      "end_ms": 575160,
      "text": "他们也处在痛苦中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 575160,
      "end_ms": 576720,
      "text": "也在挣扎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 577550,
      "end_ms": 580950,
      "text": "他们也不知道他们为什么会犯罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 580950,
      "end_ms": 584310,
      "text": "为什么会制造痛苦创伤"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 586020,
      "end_ms": 589260,
      "text": "他们本来有机会从这种痛苦当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 590460,
      "end_ms": 595100,
      "text": "重新锚定自己的价值去赎罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 596520,
      "end_ms": 599020,
      "text": "去背叛曾经的作恶的自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 599020,
      "end_ms": 601600,
      "text": "去背叛自己的雇主"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 603080,
      "end_ms": 604600,
      "text": "却不再做一个帮凶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 604600,
      "end_ms": 607800,
      "text": "但是他竟然被奖励了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 609840,
      "end_ms": 612400,
      "text": "被这些所谓女性的革命者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 614159,
      "end_ms": 614999,
      "text": "被奖励了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 614999,
      "end_ms": 616839,
      "text": "被圣母奖励了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 617540,
      "end_ms": 624950,
      "text": "他自己对于自己不正义的认定都会被取消"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 624950,
      "end_ms": 625470,
      "text": "被掩盖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 625470,
      "end_ms": 626170,
      "text": "被遮蔽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 626170,
      "end_ms": 627910,
      "text": "被欺骗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 628900,
      "end_ms": 631510,
      "text": "这些长不大的孩子永远长不大了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 631710,
      "end_ms": 634470,
      "text": "他永远不愿意去面对自己的罪恶了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 634470,
      "end_ms": 638250,
      "text": "永远不会想到犯错要付出代价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 638250,
      "end_ms": 642630,
      "text": "犯错创制造伤害要去弥补"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 642630,
      "end_ms": 644850,
      "text": "别人不能弥补"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 644850,
      "end_ms": 646670,
      "text": "就应当承受痛苦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 646670,
      "end_ms": 650929,
      "text": "他永远不知道他的痛苦由别人来弥补"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 650929,
      "end_ms": 652589,
      "text": "由阴道来弥补"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 652589,
      "end_ms": 654349,
      "text": "由享乐来弥补"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 654349,
      "end_ms": 656490,
      "text": "由子嗣来弥补"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 656770,
      "end_ms": 659210,
      "text": "天底下哪有这样的道理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 665640,
      "end_ms": 672120,
      "text": "气绝这样的邪恶的双生术砍掉他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 673840,
      "end_ms": 678100,
      "text": "这是革命团体的必然的历史使命"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 679100,
      "end_ms": 680180,
      "text": "那么要做到这一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 680180,
      "end_ms": 682340,
      "text": "单枪匹马是不够的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 682950,
      "end_ms": 684550,
      "text": "做到这一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 685610,
      "end_ms": 686710,
      "text": "要做到这一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 686710,
      "end_ms": 688930,
      "text": "你要意识到你的敌人比你更凶恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 688930,
      "end_ms": 693480,
      "text": "或者说一旦你直接把他设定为敌人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 694640,
      "end_ms": 695520,
      "text": "他们是罪恶的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 695520,
      "end_ms": 696240,
      "text": "是肮脏的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 697520,
      "end_ms": 699800,
      "text": "他们就会成为敌人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 700740,
      "end_ms": 702740,
      "text": "如何做到这点的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 704340,
      "end_ms": 706440,
      "text": "要通过集体的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 706440,
      "end_ms": 707940,
      "text": "要通过组织的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 709300,
      "end_ms": 710720,
      "text": "要通过共识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 710720,
      "end_ms": 713560,
      "text": "这些人如何赎罪呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 718500,
      "end_ms": 723220,
      "text": "俯首堕落的社会关联会继续给他们妄想幻想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 724460,
      "end_ms": 727329,
      "text": "所谓革命者女性圣母"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 727430,
      "end_ms": 731950,
      "text": "对于他们违背历史铁律的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 731950,
      "end_ms": 738510,
      "text": "违背根本的解放性的纪律的这种奖赏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 739160,
      "end_ms": 741500,
      "text": "会彻底的腐蚀他们的灵魂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 741500,
      "end_ms": 744380,
      "text": "会使让会让他们堕落的更深刻"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 744380,
      "end_ms": 746080,
      "text": "无可拯救"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 746080,
      "end_ms": 749000,
      "text": "首先要剥夺这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 749700,
      "end_ms": 751660,
      "text": "要把他们从这些泥潭当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 752980,
      "end_ms": 757610,
      "text": "从这些眩晕混乱当中连根拔起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 759050,
      "end_ms": 761170,
      "text": "往往采取的方式就是劳改"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 764160,
      "end_ms": 765480,
      "text": "好洗澡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 765480,
      "end_ms": 766320,
      "text": "现在洗的干干净净"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 766320,
      "end_ms": 766760,
      "text": "排排队"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 766760,
      "end_ms": 769100,
      "text": "然后弄个小铁床上下铺睡着"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 769100,
      "end_ms": 771040,
      "text": "然后去领领盆"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 771040,
      "end_ms": 772380,
      "text": "领毛巾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 772380,
      "end_ms": 775520,
      "text": "领这个牙刷茶缸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 776300,
      "end_ms": 778400,
      "text": "然后备调理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 778400,
      "end_ms": 780260,
      "text": "第二天出早操"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 781660,
      "end_ms": 784630,
      "text": "给他们建立重新的奖惩机制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 784630,
      "end_ms": 787150,
      "text": "全新的奖惩机制才碍于上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 787150,
      "end_ms": 790930,
      "text": "让他知道犯错误要被惩罚就做对了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 790930,
      "end_ms": 794220,
      "text": "维护弱者的共同体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 794220,
      "end_ms": 797500,
      "text": "长远的利益才可以得到奖励"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 799020,
      "end_ms": 800860,
      "text": "不是说在加害别人之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 800860,
      "end_ms": 802040,
      "text": "在犯了罪孽之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 802040,
      "end_ms": 804740,
      "text": "装出一副自己也是无辜的受害者的样子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 804740,
      "end_ms": 806220,
      "text": "其实是什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 806220,
      "end_ms": 808540,
      "text": "其实你只是绑架了预期的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 808540,
      "end_ms": 811940,
      "text": "未来的更多的受害者在这里要挟而已"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 812450,
      "end_ms": 814490,
      "text": "好像你不收买我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 814490,
      "end_ms": 816030,
      "text": "你不收买它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 816030,
      "end_ms": 818690,
      "text": "他就能够去加害更多人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 819250,
      "end_ms": 820870,
      "text": "然后你去收买了它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 820870,
      "end_ms": 822130,
      "text": "你这个就不仅仅是收买"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 822130,
      "end_ms": 823010,
      "text": "不仅仅是资长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 823010,
      "end_ms": 824010,
      "text": "不仅仅是助长了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 824010,
      "end_ms": 826319,
      "text": "而变成一种德性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 826559,
      "end_ms": 829099,
      "text": "变成一种功绩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 829099,
      "end_ms": 832350,
      "text": "这些人是卖什么的呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 837240,
      "end_ms": 840900,
      "text": "当时指向未来的要挟着要加害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 840900,
      "end_ms": 846110,
      "text": "然后你就满足我给各式样的东西满足我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 846110,
      "end_ms": 847810,
      "text": "我就不加H"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 847810,
      "end_ms": 850850,
      "text": "所以你的这种满足就是神圣的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 850850,
      "end_ms": 851610,
      "text": "就是奉献"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 851610,
      "end_ms": 852730,
      "text": "就是有功劳的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 852730,
      "end_ms": 854890,
      "text": "这是一张罪恶的交易"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 855620,
      "end_ms": 857380,
      "text": "你提供给这些东西给他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 858660,
      "end_ms": 860780,
      "text": "表面上他会假装好像乖了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 860780,
      "end_ms": 861740,
      "text": "好像安定了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 861740,
      "end_ms": 863220,
      "text": "实际上呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 868660,
      "end_ms": 871700,
      "text": "未来或许能安定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 871700,
      "end_ms": 874420,
      "text": "但是那些罪恶就这样算了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 876820,
      "end_ms": 879580,
      "text": "你的伤痛痛苦就这样算了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 880150,
      "end_ms": 881790,
      "text": "谁有资格原谅他们吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 883110,
      "end_ms": 884230,
      "text": "哪应当是那些受害者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 885230,
      "end_ms": 887390,
      "text": "那应当是更朴素的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 894540,
      "end_ms": 897540,
      "text": "我们应当心如铁石"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 898380,
      "end_ms": 902300,
      "text": "才能敲碎他们身上的锈壳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 903410,
      "end_ms": 908970,
      "text": "才能把禁锢在这种铁锈坚硬的外壳当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 908970,
      "end_ms": 910930,
      "text": "的他们的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 912820,
      "end_ms": 915740,
      "text": "还尚有生命力的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 923300,
      "end_ms": 932900,
      "text": "肌体肌里或者说是血肉拯救出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 937220,
      "end_ms": 938220,
      "text": "最后我要说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 939420,
      "end_ms": 942600,
      "text": "凡是对我们成员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 942600,
      "end_ms": 951560,
      "text": "我们团队的正式成员施加过人身武力威胁的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 952200,
      "end_ms": 960630,
      "text": "施加过违禁的一些非法的那些伤害的威胁的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 961170,
      "end_ms": 963570,
      "text": "或者说啊我说是施加过威胁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 963570,
      "end_ms": 969270,
      "text": "甚至说施加过实际行动的拘禁过恐吓过这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 969270,
      "end_ms": 975170,
      "text": "或者说现场殴打过或怎么样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 975930,
      "end_ms": 977890,
      "text": "我们不会原谅"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 980300,
      "end_ms": 982000,
      "text": "而且我们是当真的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 982000,
      "end_ms": 986340,
      "text": "我不会认为这些东西是一时的口嗨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 986340,
      "end_ms": 988569,
      "text": "或者说一时的这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 993800,
      "end_ms": 995880,
      "text": "大话谎话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 995880,
      "end_ms": 997640,
      "text": "我明确说一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 997640,
      "end_ms": 999780,
      "text": "我们统统都是当真的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 999780,
      "end_ms": 1001870,
      "text": "我们现在弱小"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 1002110,
      "end_ms": 1003470,
      "text": "几乎什么都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 1003470,
      "end_ms": 1004950,
      "text": "但是我们是当真的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 1004950,
      "end_ms": 1007530,
      "text": "我们把这些威胁当真"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 1008090,
      "end_ms": 1010170,
      "text": "我们不会束手待毙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 1011970,
      "end_ms": 1014170,
      "text": "我们不会任人揉捏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 1014370,
      "end_ms": 1016330,
      "text": "我们不会被你们骑在头上拉屎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 1017330,
      "end_ms": 1018930,
      "text": "你说出这些话的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 1018930,
      "end_ms": 1021490,
      "text": "你一定会承受历史的代价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 1025060,
      "end_ms": 1026740,
      "text": "你做出这些伤害的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 1028060,
      "end_ms": 1030460,
      "text": "你要考虑好你如何赎罪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 1032659,
      "end_ms": 1034759,
      "text": "你不愿意面对这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 1034759,
      "end_ms": 1036699,
      "text": "逃避到所谓的安定的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 1036699,
      "end_ms": 1037858,
      "text": "上了岸的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 1037858,
      "end_ms": 1038539,
      "text": "被收买"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 1038539,
      "end_ms": 1043919,
      "text": "被贿赂的不义的幸福生活能量曲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 1043919,
      "end_ms": 1045878,
      "text": "你逃不了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 1049020,
      "end_ms": 1052780,
      "text": "你一定会接受历史的正义的制裁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 1053740,
      "end_ms": 1056220,
      "text": "我们责无旁贷"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 1057690,
      "end_ms": 1060090,
      "text": "我们不抱有任何的幻想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 1062460,
      "end_ms": 1063780,
      "text": "就讲到这里"
    }
